   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **The Tall Tall Grass**: back after 156 archived shows (1069 days); rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n- **The Old Mountineer**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Cocaine Blues**: rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n- **Little Sadie**: rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n- **Nobody's Business**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **One Loaf Of Bread**: back after 192 archived shows (1208 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **Ramblin' Letters**: back after 383 archived shows (2700 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2022-08-04.sibert.ca14c.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 18 songs; 108 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2022-08-04.sibert.ca14c.flac16**: taped by Ryan Sibert; source: Church Audio CA-14 (cardioid) > Ugly Box > Tascam DR-40 (16/44.1) [1]. Also: Transfer went from SD card to PC, edited in Audacity with normalizing and fades, split and encoded to FLAC, with ffp checksums and foobar2000 tags [1]",
